EmailTemplate.textOnly:
Hello {!Contact.FirstName},

I’m excited that you are ready to begin your studies at Arizona State University in the Bachelor of Global Management program (http://www.thunderbird.edu/bachelor-global-management). This email summarizes our earlier conversation with the highlights of your new program.

As I explained when we talked, the BGM program will provide you with the core skills you’ll need to start a career in international business, prepare you to become proficient in a foreign language, and help you understand the cultural aspects of regions across the world.

An exciting aspect of the program includes a required international internship, allowing you to take language and culture courses at a host institution at your internship destination or online through ASU.
As part of the professional development plan, you’ll develop an online portfolio to showcase your global management skills, qualities and work experience for potential employers to review.

Finally, there will be exclusive housing for you with networking opportunities and engaging student activities.

<Customized paragraph by admission representative>. If you have any questions, please contact Anna Calloway at Anna.Calloway@asu.edu.

We look forward to having you at this exciting new program!

Sincerely,

{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}
Admission Services
{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}


If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.

{!Case.Thread_Id}
